  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "作者解释铃昌陀武因武曲忌引动最凶，文昌忌亦凶；四星同命或三方四正会合须区分。投河是突然溃败的比喻，不能断必自尽。作者从廉贞财帛与财与囚仇、武曲忌铃星寡宿、阴火克阴金及陀罗暗厄四方面释凶；古注壬流年戌陀合三星为引述条件，不改成普遍死亡预言。",
  "summary_en": "The author explains Ling Chang Tuo Wu as especially adverse when activated by Wu Qu Hua Ji, with Wen Chang Hua Ji also harmful. Four stars sharing Life and meeting through trines and opposition are distinct alternatives. Throwing oneself into a river is explained as a metaphor for sudden collapse, not inevitable suicide. Four explanations involve Lian Zhen in Wealth and Cai Yu Qiu Chou, Wu Qu Hua Ji with Ling Xing and Gu Su, yin fire attacking yin metal, and Tuo Luo’s hidden adversity. The older quotation about Ren-year Tuo Luo at Xu is retained as an attributed conditional claim, not a universal death prediction.",
